{"verses":[{"index":1,"text":"Ole wake kila safihi, msengenyaji"},{"index":2,"text":"Aliye kusanya mali na kuyahisabu"},{"index":3,"text":"Anadhani ya kuwa mali yake yatambakisha milele"},{"index":4,"text":"Hasha! Atavurumishwa katika H'ut'ama"},{"index":5,"text":"Na nani atakujuvya ni nini H'ut'ama"},{"index":6,"text":"Moto wa Mwenyezi Mungu ulio washwa"},{"index":7,"text":"Ambao unapanda nyoyoni"},{"index":8,"text":"Hakika huo utafungiwa nao"},{"index":9,"text":"Kwenye nguzo zilio nyooshwa"}]}